{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的 S03（38秒）和 S11（22秒）感受提示出现得过密，观众容易忙着追逐文字而顾不上音乐；X 的静态短词在快速浏览时反而更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用加亮短语让观众迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，再用小字、按音乐进程出现的感受补充具体的声音变化、身体反应和情绪转折，阅读层次更清楚。尤其是亲近、怀念、失落、动摇到重新决定的过程，Y 把人物心理和音乐细节结合得更紧，前后反复出现的旋律与记忆也形成了连续的呼应。X 的文字本身并不难懂，但右侧短词经常只是并列堆放，较难判断各自对应哪个叙事节点或音乐瞬间。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ea93374-ebb4-4eb4-a752-fbcdf729bc8e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172422820990Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:25:27.458583+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "231e5e4db6ab1689dbde9534eeaa8553e27df51b11792740627e83f7a2bff339", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch